{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","canonical_person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["2pi_e3t_aia"],"persons":[{"id":"2pi_e3t_aia","label":"司馬祐〔汝南威王、司馬矩子〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"祐","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0034","c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0000","c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0020","c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0093","c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0112"]},{"surface":"永猷","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0034","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju","quote":"祐"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0000","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","quote":"祐"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0002","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","quote":"永猷"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0020","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","quote":"祐"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0093","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","quote":"祐"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0112","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","quote":"祐"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"司馬祐〔汝南威王、司馬矩子〕，見本組原文及身份互校。"},{"id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAACB","label":"司馬矩","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"矩","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line029:m0006","c-jinshu-059-liang-son-cui:p001:m0006","c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0000"]},{"surface":"延明","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line029","quote":"矩","mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line029:m0006"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-cui:p001:m0006","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-cui:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-cui","quote":"矩"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0000","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju","quote":"矩"},{"mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0002","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju","quote":"延明"}],"identity_note":"卷059固定見證本地人物；未按同名跨史合併。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAC","generation_distance":1,"source_assertion_id":"a-jinshu059-list-father-矩","status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018","quote":"汝南文成王亮，字子翼，宣帝第四子也。少清警有才用，仕魏為散騎侍郎、萬歲亭侯，拜東中郎將，進封廣陽鄉侯。討諸葛誕于壽春，失利，免官。頃之，拜左將軍，加散騎常侍、假節，出監豫州諸軍事。五等建，改封祁陽伯，轉鎮西將軍。武帝踐阼，封扶風郡王，邑萬戶，置騎司馬，增參軍掾屬，持節、都督關中雍、涼諸軍事。會秦州刺史胡烈為羌虜所害，亮遣將軍劉旂、騎督敬琰赴救，不進，坐是貶為平西將軍。旂當斬，亮與軍司曹冏上言，節度之咎由亮而出，乞丐旂死。詔曰：「高平困急，計城中及旂足以相拔，就不能徑至，尚當深進。今奔突有投，而坐視覆敗，故加旂大戮。今若罪不在旂，當有所在。」有司又奏免亮官，削爵土。詔惟免官。頃之，拜撫軍將軍。是歲，吳將步闡來降，假亮節都督諸軍事以納之。尋加侍中之服。","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line018:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line020","quote":"咸甯初，以扶風池陽四千一百戶為太妃伏氏湯沐邑，置家令丞僕，後改食南郡枝江。太妃嘗有小疾，祓于洛水，亮兄弟三人侍從，並持節鼓吹，震耀洛濱。武帝登陵雲臺望見，曰：「伏妃可謂富貴矣。」其年進號衛將軍，加侍中。時宗室殷盛，無相統攝，乃以亮為宗師，本官如故，使訓導觀察，有不遵禮法，小者正以義方，大者隨事聞奏。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line022","quote":"三年，徙封汝南，出為鎮南大將軍、都督豫州軍事，開府、假節，之國，給追鋒車、皁輪犢車，錢五十萬。頃之，征亮為侍中、撫軍大將軍，領後軍將軍，統冠軍、步兵、射聲、長水等營，給兵五百人，騎百匹。遷太尉、錄尚書事、領太子太傅，侍中如故。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line024","quote":"及武帝寢疾，為楊駿所排，乃以亮為侍中、大司馬、假黃鉞、大都督、督豫州諸軍事，出鎮許昌，加軒懸之樂，六佾之舞。封子羕為西陽公。未發，帝大漸，詔留亮委以後事。楊駿聞之，從中書監華暠索詔視，遂不還。帝崩，亮懼駿疑己，辭疾不入，于大司馬門外敘哀而已，表求過葬。駿欲討亮，亮知之，問計于廷尉何勖。勖曰：「今朝廷皆歸心於公，公何不討人而懼為人所討！」或說亮率所領入廢駿，亮不能用，夜馳赴許昌，故得免。及駿誅，詔曰：「大司馬、汝南王亮體道沖粹，通識政理，宣翼之績，顯於本朝，《二南》之風，流于方夏，將憑遠猷，以康王化。其以亮為太宰、錄尚書事，入朝不趨，劍履上殿，增掾屬十人，給千兵百騎，與太保衛瓘對掌朝政。」亮論賞誅楊駿之功過差，欲以苟悅眾心，由是失望。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line026","quote":"楚王瑋有勳而好立威，亮憚之，欲奪其兵權。瑋甚憾，乃承賈后旨，誣亮與瓘有廢立之謀，矯詔遣其長史公孫宏與積弩將軍李肇夜以兵圍之。帳下督李龍白外有變，請距之，亮不聽。俄然楚兵登牆而呼，亮驚曰：「吾無二心，何至於是！若有詔書，其可見乎？」宏等不許，促兵攻之。長史劉准謂亮曰：「觀此必是奸謀，府中俊乂如林，猶可盡力距戰。」又弗聽，遂為肇所執，而歎曰：「我之忠心，可破示天下也，如何無道，枉殺不辜！」是時大熱，兵人坐亮于車下，時人憐之，為之交扇。將及日中，無敢害者。瑋出令曰：「能斬亮者，賞布千匹。」遂為亂兵所害，投於北門之壁，鬢髮耳鼻皆悉毀焉。及瑋誅，追復亮爵位，給東園溫明秘器，朝服一襲，錢三百萬，布絹三百匹，喪葬之禮如安平獻王孚故事，廟設軒懸之樂。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line029","quote":"有五子：粹、矩、羕、宗、熙。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line029:m0006"}],"interpretation_note":"完整亮單元及有五子名單先通過原生模型驗證，才配置亮支ID；名單次序未轉出生排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ju-son-you-ws2650517","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","raw_mention_count":5,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0000","c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0002","c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0020","c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0093","c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0112"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0000","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0002","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0002"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0020","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0020"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0093","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0093"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0112","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001:m0112"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":5,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":5,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"5處獨立位置，5個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju-ws2650517","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0034"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0034","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0034"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-059-ju-son-you-ws2650517"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:source_review1-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","source_quote":"祐字永猷。永安中，從惠帝北征。帝遷長安，祐反國。及帝還洛，以征南兵八百人給之，特置四部牙門。永興初，率眾依東海王越，討劉喬有功，拜揚武將軍，以江夏雲杜益封，並前二萬五千戶。越征汲桑，表留祐領兵三千守許昌，加鼓吹、麾旗。越還，祐歸國。永嘉末，以寇賊充斥，遂南渡江，元帝命為軍諮祭酒。建武初，為鎮軍將軍。太興末，領左軍將軍，太甯中，進號衛將軍，加散騎常侍。咸和元年，薨，贈侍中、特進。","reading":"祐字永猷，自永安至咸和元年按原文逐節記官封與薨。","note":"祐字永猷，自永安至咸和元年按原文逐節記官封與薨。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p001","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":190,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ju-son-you-ws2650517"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:source_review2-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","source_quote":"子恭王統立，以南頓王宗謀反，被廢。其後成帝哀亮一門殄絕，詔統復封，累遷秘書監、侍中。薨，追贈光祿勳。子義立，官至散騎常侍。薨，子遵之立。義熙初，梁州刺史劉稚謀反，推遵之為主，事泄，伏誅。弟楷之子蓮扶立。宋受禪，國除。","reading":"統、義、遵之相嗣；劉稚謀反與蓮扶承祀另錄，楷的親稱以原句為據。","note":"統、義、遵之相嗣；劉稚謀反與蓮扶承祀另錄，楷的親稱以原句為據。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you:p002","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":108,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-ju-son-you","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-ju-son-you-ws2650517"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin059-volume-you-father","subject_person_id":"2pi_e3t_aia","object_person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAACB","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子祐立"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju-ws2650517","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001","quote":"矩字延明。拜世子，為屯騎校尉，與父亮同被害。追贈典軍將軍，諡懷王。子祐立，是為威王。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0034","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-son-ju:p001:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"矩卒立子祐。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_as